    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4894" root="جأن" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُؤْنَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A receptacle of the kind termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَفَط</span>,
<i>covered with skin, for the perfumes of the seller
of perfumes;</i> as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُونَةٌ</span>: originally with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ء</span>:
pl. like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُرَدٌ</span> [i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُوَنٌ</span>: thus in the TA, without <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ء</span>]. (K.) See also art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جون</span>.

